ed with Demonstration Replay (Random) fails to recover the motion frame by frame. We show in Fig. 8 the per-frame pose error. Even the average error over the whole trajectory for both variant are similar, Demonstration Replay (Threshold) gives a lower maximum per-frame error, which indicates a faithful recovery of the demonstration. This implies that simply minimizing the pose error may not suffice to learn a policy that tracks the demonstration closely. Finergrained guidance based on the current performance of the policy is required."
